# Room artifacts persisted per round are large and untrusted-origin (probe
# output, extracted kit copies). Commit only the curated text record
# (ROUNDS/AB-ROUNDS.md, CARD, PROMPT, transcript.jsonl, checker-output,
# ab-verdict, checks/*.txt); never the nested repos or tarballs. This is the
# ID-640 class: an untracked kit/ copy carries its own test-meta.sh and trips
# filesystem scans, and one `git add -A` would commit ~90MB.
*/**/kit/
*/**/kit-extract/
*/**/fixture-repo/
*/**/kit.tar.gz
*/**/checks/*.sh
